================================================================================
IMPORTANT — THE INDEXED DATA IS NOT COVERED BY EITHER LICENCE
================================================================================
This repository indexes third-party datasets. It does not host, mirror or
redistribute them. Every dataset remains under the licence of its own holder,
which may be more restrictive than the licences above.

The `usage` flags in this catalogue summarise published licence text as of the
survey date. They are a research aid, NOT legal advice. Entries marked
"unclear" mean the holder published no usable terms. Verify directly with the
data holder before relying on any dataset, and always before commercial use.
